---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'; import LeadDialog from '@/components/LeadDialog.astro';
---
<Layout title="A living operating system for work"><div class="codex"><aside class="rail"><b>CW</b><span>01<br/>02<br/>03<br/>04</span><i>©26</i></aside><main><nav><b>CODEX WORKPLACE</b><span>KNOWLEDGE OPERATING SYSTEM</span><button data-lead>REQUEST A WORKSPACE</button></nav><section class="knowledge"><div class="kcopy"><p>THE COMPANY BRAIN, MADE VISIBLE</p><h1>Work knows<br/>where to go.</h1><p>Codex turns decisions, documents and expertise into a navigable system your team can actually use.</p><button data-lead>MAP OUR KNOWLEDGE →</button></div><div class="graph"><img src="/assets/generated/hero-knowledge.jpg" alt="Abstract organizational knowledge graph"/><span class="node n1">DECISION</span><span class="node n2">OWNER</span><span class="node n3">CONTEXT</span></div></section><section class="sequence"><header><small>THE LIVING CODEX</small><h2>From scattered memory to shared momentum.</h2></header><ol><li><b>Capture</b><p>Decisions land with context, owner and next action.</p></li><li><b>Connect</b><p>People, projects and evidence become one map.</p></li><li><b>Retrieve</b><p>The right answer appears inside the flow of work.</p></li><li><b>Evolve</b><p>Knowledge stays current because the system shows decay.</p></li></ol></section><section class="workplace"><img src="/assets/generated/workplace-team.jpg" alt="Modern collaborative workplace team"/><blockquote>“We stopped asking where the answer lives.”<span>— Operations lead, distributed studio</span></blockquote><button data-lead>Design the workplace layer</button></section></main><LeadDialog /></div></Layout>
<style>:global(.site-header),:global(.site-footer){display:none}.codex{display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;background:#f3f1eb;color:#151515;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.rail{height:100vh;position:sticky;top:0;border-right:1px solid;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:24px 0}.rail span{line-height:3;color:#888}.rail i{font-style:normal}.codex main>nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:26px 3vw;border-bottom:1px solid}.codex button{border:1px solid;background:#171717;color:white;padding:12px 18px}.knowledge{min-height:78vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;padding:5vw 3vw;gap:4vw}.kcopy{align-self:center}.kcopy h1{font-size:clamp(4.5rem,9vw,9rem);line-height:.78;letter-spacing:-.08em}.kcopy p{max-width:530px}.graph{position:relative}.graph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(1)}.node{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:#ccff35;padding:24px 14px;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:900}.n1{left:-20px;top:18%}.n2{right:-20px;top:45%;background:#ff694d}.n3{left:20%;bottom:-20px;background:#73b7ff}.sequence{padding:8vw 4vw;background:#171717;color:white}.sequence header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr}.sequence h2{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem);margin-top:0}.sequence ol{list-style:none;padding:0}.sequence li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;border-top:1px solid #555;padding:24px 0}.sequence li b{font-size:2rem}.workplace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;padding:5vw;gap:5vw}.workplace img{width:100%;height:620px;object-fit:cover}.workplace blockquote{font:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5rem)/1 Georgia,serif}.workplace blockquote span{display:block;font:1rem Arial;margin-top:30px}@media(max-width:760px){.codex{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rail{display:none}.codex main>nav span{display:none}.knowledge,.workplace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.graph{height:50vh}.sequence header,.sequence li{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
